    {
      "id": "claim_f78f581e2b894a69842bc9f964d13137",
      "statement": "This assistant-graph endpoint is a consumer-facing dependency of the CopilotKit/AG-UI LangGraph client used by the member frontend, which requests graph topology ahead of ordinary non-regenerate agent runs; perimeter admission of /assistants/coach/graph is pinned by tests/agent/test_perimeter_copilotkit.py::test_copilotkit_captured_upstream_routes_are_admitted alongside tests/server/test_assistants_store.py's topology/missing-assistant/xray/policy coverage.",
