    {
      "id": "claim_f0e903a4731a4e81b321f3b5996ef3b0",
      "statement": "Resume (command) run requests are replay-key idempotent: RunEngine derives a replay key from thread_id, assistant_id, and the serialized resume command, and a repeated submission with the same key returns the previously recorded run rather than starting a new one.",
