      "id": "claim_c5057dc8e1314f0eb8d225847785fb3b",
      "statement": "server/config.py's load_config requires DATABASE_URI (or the Fly-provided DATABASE_URL alias, must not conflict if both set) whenever SERVER_STORAGE=postgres, and raises for any SERVER_STORAGE value other than memory or postgres.",
