      "id": "claim_fddca5ca5636487786328706dc24cf81",
      "statement": "Postgres registry DDL (hc_threads, hc_runs, hc_crons plus supporting indexes) is created idempotently under a Postgres advisory lock (pg_advisory_lock/pg_advisory_unlock) in PostgresRegistries.setup(), guarding concurrent create_storage calls against racing table creation.",
