    {
      "id": "claim_f70b28c1d5d542a08830fe693a51e026",
      "statement": "Production (deploy/fly.prod.toml) runs SERVER_STORAGE=postgres against a dedicated Fly Postgres cluster (hc-rag-server-prod-db) with the vector extension; the flip shipped in v1.0.7 (executed 2026-08-24). Since then, threads, store items, and cron registrations survive deploys/restarts/OOMs, while in-flight runs, the pending-run queue, and open SSE streams remain process-local state that is still lost on a deploy.",
