    {
      "id": "claim_c3cfccd1e7a44e259267669ace96001e",
      "statement": "In Postgres storage mode, RunEngine redacts persisted run input/command payloads to the literal string \"[redacted]\" at rest (PERSISTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTION) while keeping the real payload only in in-process runtime state; in memory storage mode the raw payload is stored as-is in the in-process registry, so code must not assume either redaction behavior universally.",
